  m_text: Welcome! You have been chosen as a test subject for the MOX corporation.
    Our goal is to test humanity's survival skills and wits against our artificially
    created mutants. Beware as these monsters are able to track your every move,
    if you are caught; run, or face your demise. Make your way through the mazes
    and puzzle rooms if you want to escape. Good luck test subject X01.
